@startuml target_slash_command_frontend_components
title Target Slash Command Frontend Components

' Source baseline: pi-mono-java@6f52fddc87a03c20916fc7b6ef1de87f6a7a8cf5
' Source evidence: frontend/src/App.vue, setup and submit
' Source evidence: frontend/src/components/ComposerBox.vue, handleKeydown and template
' Source evidence: frontend/src/composables/useRuntimeApi.ts, sendMessage and requestRaw
' Source evidence: frontend/src/types/product.ts and frontend/src/types/runtime.ts
' Contract evidence: executeSessionCommand response variants at design baseline 88f4df16
' Observed behavior: the current debug workbench has one message draft and no command gateway, catalog, parser, or command result projection.
' Target-only design: every element marked target is proposed and is not implemented at the source baseline.
' Design reason: keep discovery, immutable invocation decoding, ephemeral results, and ordinary chat history as separate responsibilities.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFCFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #2C2724
skinparam ArrowColor #7A6F69
skinparam packageBorderColor #CDBEB6
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8F3F0
skinparam componentBorderColor #BFAEA5
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam interfaceBorderColor #A9472B
skinparam interfaceBackgroundColor #FFF6F1
skinparam noteBorderColor #CDBEB6
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9E8
left to right direction

package "Existing application shell" as ExistingPkg {
  component "App.vue\n[current]" as App
  component "ComposerBox.vue\n[current, extended]" as Composer
  component "ConversationTimeline\n[current, unchanged]" as Timeline
  component "Session and model state\n[current, extended]" as SessionState
  component "Attachment draft state\n[current concept, extended]" as AttachmentState
}

package "Slash presentation [target-only]" as PresentationPkg {
  component "SlashCommandButton" as SlashButton
  component "CommandPalette" as Palette
  component "CommandArgumentHint" as ArgumentHint
  component "CommandResultRegion" as ResultRegion
  component "CommandResultRenderers" as Renderers
}

package "Slash application state [target-only]" as StatePkg {
  component "useSlashCommands" as UseSlash
  component "CommandDraftStore\nper active chat" as DraftStore
  component "CommandCatalogStore\nper active chat" as CatalogStore
  component "CommandParser\npure function" as Parser
  component "CommandPresentationRegistry" as Registry
}

package "Gateway boundary [target-only]" as GatewayPkg {
  interface "CommandGateway" as Gateway
  component "MateCommandGateway\nproduction target" as MateGateway
  component "RuntimeCommandGateway\ncontrolled development only" as RuntimeGateway
}

cloud "mate-service public API\nGET descriptor confirmed\nexecute contract pending" as MateApi
cloud "Runtime internal API\nGET and Builtin POST confirmed" as RuntimeApi

App *-- Composer
App *-- Timeline
App *-- ResultRegion
Composer *-- SlashButton
Composer *-- Palette
Composer *-- ArgumentHint
Composer --> UseSlash
SlashButton --> UseSlash
Palette --> UseSlash
ResultRegion --> Registry
UseSlash *-- DraftStore
UseSlash *-- CatalogStore
UseSlash --> Parser
UseSlash --> Registry : present by expected result kind
UseSlash --> Gateway
UseSlash --> SessionState : apply validated resource response
UseSlash --> AttachmentState : preserve or admit files
Registry --> Renderers
Gateway <|.. MateGateway
Gateway <|.. RuntimeGateway
MateGateway --> MateApi
RuntimeGateway --> RuntimeApi

note bottom of Timeline
  Command results never become
  ConversationTurn or durable history.
end note

note bottom of MateGateway
  Production execution remains gated until
  route, authentication, errors, Skill result,
  and file reference contracts are confirmed.
end note

note bottom of DraftStore
  Separate message and command buffers prevent
  a Slash attempt from destroying user text.
end note
@enduml

@startuml slash_composer_state
title Slash Composer Interaction State

' Source baseline: pi-mono-java@6f52fddc87a03c20916fc7b6ef1de87f6a7a8cf5
' Source evidence: frontend/src/components/ComposerBox.vue, handleKeydown and textarea binding
' Source evidence: frontend/src/App.vue, message ref and submit
' Observed behavior: the current composer has a single message state and Enter submits an ordinary message.
' Target-only design: this state machine is the proposed Slash interaction model.
' Design reason: explicit selection and explicit execution prevent accidental state-changing commands.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFCFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #2C2724
skinparam ArrowColor #7A6F69
skinparam stateBorderColor #BFAEA5
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #CDBEB6
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9E8
skinparam nodesep 34
skinparam ranksep 42
top to bottom direction

[*] --> MessageDraft
MessageDraft : Ordinary message buffer is authoritative
MessageDraft --> BrowsingCatalog : first-character slash or Slash button

state BrowsingCatalog
BrowsingCatalog : Full list or prefix-filtered list
BrowsingCatalog --> EditingArguments : select descriptor
BrowsingCatalog --> MessageDraft : Escape, cancel, or lone slash Backspace

state EditingArguments
EditingArguments : Canonical name plus editable arguments
EditingArguments --> Executing : explicit second Enter or Run
EditingArguments --> MessageDraft : cancel and restore suspended draft

state Executing
Executing --> EditingArguments : failure, preserve command draft
Executing --> ResultVisible : success

state ResultVisible
ResultVisible : Ephemeral result, latest one per active chat
ResultVisible --> BrowsingCatalog : start another command
ResultVisible --> MessageDraft : dismiss, refresh, or switch chat

note right of BrowsingCatalog
  Prefix filtering preserves server order.
  No fuzzy reordering and no auto-execution.
end note

note right of EditingArguments
  hint is display-only.
  Files are admitted only when acceptsFiles is true.
end note

note left of BrowsingCatalog
  No automatic fallback to an ordinary message.
  IME composition never triggers a mode transition.
end note

note right of MessageDraft
  Slash button entry suspends the existing
  message draft and files until exit or success.
end note
@enduml

@startuml slash_command_execution_flow
title Slash Command Discovery and Execution Flow

' Source baseline: pi-mono-java@6f52fddc87a03c20916fc7b6ef1de87f6a7a8cf5
' Source evidence: frontend/src/composables/useRuntimeApi.ts, requestRaw and return surface
' Contract evidence: Runtime operations listSessionCommands and executeSessionCommand
' Observed behavior: the current frontend has no command HTTP methods or command response projectors.
' Target-only design: the browser workflow and production Mate gateway are proposed.
' Design reason: decode from an immutable invocation, never replay an uncertain mutation, and reconcile through authoritative resources.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFCFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #2C2724
skinparam ArrowColor #7A6F69
skinparam participantBorderColor #BFAEA5
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #BFAEA5
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F3F0
skinparam noteBorderColor #CDBEB6
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9E8
hide footbox

actor User
participant "Composer" as Composer
participant "useSlashCommands\n[target]" as Slash
participant "CommandGateway\n[target]" as Gateway
participant "Command API" as Api
participant "Session and model state" as State
participant "CommandResultRegion\n[target]" as Result

User -> Composer : enter Slash mode
Composer -> Slash : open(activeChatId)
Slash -> Gateway : listCommands(activeChatId)
Gateway -> Api : GET command descriptors
Api --> Gateway : server-ordered descriptors
Gateway --> Slash : descriptors
Slash --> Composer : render listbox

User -> Composer : select command
Composer -> Slash : select(name)
Slash --> Composer : canonical draft and input hint
User -> Composer : explicit Run
Composer -> Slash : execute(name, arguments, files)
Slash -> Slash : freeze invocation and expected result kind
Slash -> Gateway : executeCommand(invocation)
Gateway -> Api : POST command

alt success
  Api --> Gateway : command-specific JSON
  Gateway -> Gateway : validate against expected result kind
  Gateway --> Slash : typed result plus invocation
  Slash -> State : apply authoritative Session or Models when present
  Slash -> Result : render by expected result kind
  Slash -> Slash : mark catalog stale
else 404 or 409
  Api --> Gateway : structured error
  Gateway --> Slash : failure
  Slash -> Slash : preserve draft and mark catalog stale
  Slash -> Gateway : refresh descriptors
  note over Slash,Gateway
    Refresh is read-only.
    The command POST is never replayed automatically.
  end note
else network outcome unknown
  Api x-- Gateway : connection lost
  Gateway --> Slash : uncertain outcome
  Slash -> State : reconcile Session, Models, or Events as applicable
  Slash --> Composer : preserve draft and require explicit action
end

note over Gateway,Api
  Production Mate execution remains disabled
  until its public execute contract is confirmed.
end note

note over Slash,Gateway
  The model command is polymorphic:
  empty arguments expect Models;
  non-empty arguments expect Session.
end note
@enduml
